# CareFlow: Clinical Pathway Process Mining

## 1. Project Overview

CareFlow uses process mining to understand patient journeys and identify delays in hospital workflows.

## 2. Example Patient Journey

1. Patient Registration
2. Triage
3. X-Ray
4. Return to Triage
5. Treatment

## 3. Process Analysis

The repeated Triage activity after X-Ray is an example workflow that should be investigated. Process mining can help identify how frequently this occurs and how it affects patient waiting time.

## 4. Expected Outcome

Identify repeated activities, workflow bottlenecks, and opportunities to improve hospital operations.

Note: This is an illustrative workflow, not a finding from actual hospital data.